[[Aurene's Insight]] is a [[Legendary weapon|legendary]] [[staff]] crafted in the [[Mystic Forge]].

== Lore ==
{{Legendary unlock text|[[Balthazar|You]] make [[Aurene|me]] furious. If you had truly wanted anything but revenge, [[Pact Commander|my champion]] could have helped you instead of [[To Kill a God|killing]] you. You wouldn't have been alone. I wish I could have talked to you. I wish I believed it could have helped.}}

